                                                "example_id": "8531a4bd-e9c4-49aa-b186-f30824be97ab",
                                                "sense_id": "eadbda64-831c-31ac-902d-e4aa3c1d0552",
                                                "text": "“The playbook presents an antiscience, antidata, and antimedicine agenda,” according to a piece last year by Boston University researchers in JAMA."
                                            }
